{"reviews":[{"id":"B07DM93SQF-0","r":5.0,"t":"Um hello what are you waiting for?","x":"I.love.kiss. It fits perfectly it\u2019s beautiful and stay on for at least 2 weeks!!!! HELLO WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?? but it ASAP!","h":64,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-1","r":5.0,"t":"5 stars","x":"Overall I\u2019m very happy with these nails.  I go back and forth between acrylics, gel and glue on\u2019s.  These are really pretty, I filed them down a little.  I do wish they were a smidge thicker but so far no issues and it\u2019s been a week.  I have received many compliments. Will order these again.  Update:  they lasted so long I took them off and applied another set of kiss nails.  Honestly they lasted longer than my acrylics or gels would have before needing a fill and these are way easier to remove ","h":40,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-2","r":5.0,"t":"Very sturdy, great quality... not even one came off .. buy buy buy..","x":"This purchase was definitely worth it.. I wanted to get my nails done but I didn\u2019t want to pay nail salon fees so I thought I\u2019d give this a try. Even thought they were long it was quite and easy fix. The nails are very sturdy, this is my second week with them in and have not had to restick any of them since first putting them on and let me tell you my job requires me to type all day and plenty of hand washing. I received many compliments on my nails. I even purchased more and got my coworker to ","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-3","r":5.0,"t":"Good nails","x":"I loved them,  just like any other kiss product. I have been using kiss for years because I was tired of paying so much at the salon! And these are super cute, kiss is the best brand and most durable out of all of them.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-4","r":2.0,"t":"Beautiful but weak","x":"The two stars are because they truly are a beautiful color and I\u2019ve received numerous compliments on them. But ultimately I wear faux nails regularly and am excellent at applying them but this is the first set ever that has done this. Not sure how clear it is in picture one but all 3 of the diamond design accent nails split at the base. All 3. I\u2019ve never had a set of faux nails split like this.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-5","r":5.0,"t":"High quality and long lasting.","x":"Kiss has the best quality and assortment of glue ons / press ons. These are a beautiful shade of pastel pink, with an interesting geometric design. I can usually make a set of these last two weeks if I'm careful with them.","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-6","r":5.0,"t":"Good nails","x":"They\u2019re long like acrylics and are very pretty.Also good quality.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"The shape is just right on my hands. I only find this length on Amazon. Love the style and the color works with anything you wear","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-8","r":5.0,"t":"Long press on!","x":"Cute but too long for this mom! they lasted 5 days and then I had to take them off!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-9","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE THESE!","x":"I use the Kiss instant glue instead of the glue provided and make sure to keep my nails/hands out of water for a few hours.  I often put them on at night right before falling asleep...they stay put for at least two weeks.  They do weaken your nail a bit but will not do a ton of damage so long as you remove them properly.  I do find that the using the sticky tabs instead of the nail glue causes more damage to your nail..so I stay away from the tabs.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-10","r":5.0,"t":"Very glam but long","x":"These nails are long but look very polished. Depending on your nail bee you may need to do some filing but it will be worth it. I\u2019ve gotten so many compliments. So far they\u2019ve lasted 2 weeks with no lifting but I do a combination method with the glue AND the gel tabs to keep them secure longer.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-11","r":2.0,"t":"Talons not nails...","x":"Stay away from these - they look incredibly cheap compared to other kiss nails that I\u2019ve purchased and are incredibly long. I have spent a good 30 minutes shaving them down hoping for them to look decent. Steer away from these talons.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-12","r":1.0,"t":"not worth it :(","x":"im so disappointed. the shape of these nails is terrible. it looks very bad and was a waste of money. some of the nails were flat and some were way too curved.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-13","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and quick! \ud83d\udc99","x":"Love them! They are very long so keep that in mind ! So easy to put on. I will be doing these instead of going to get my nails done from now on!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-14","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"These are very pretty. Good quality. If youre looking for some really cute nails that look like you got them done get These! Would buy again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-15","r":4.0,"t":"Long!","x":"[[VIDEOID:86c0ae959e92157d37c59cdac3089183]] Love these! However, they are long af!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-16","r":4.0,"t":"Long!","x":"[[VIDEOID:86c0ae959e92157d37c59cdac3089183]] Love these! However, they are long af!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-17","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"They are so cute! I'm in love with them!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-18","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous!","x":"[[VIDEOID:74234c303fc1bc91ec7287385de0b807]] Purchased these to wear for my birthday. They\u2019re so pretty in person. I had to file the nail to fit the shape of my nail bed but that wasn\u2019t an inconvenience. I used the Kiss glue in the green bottle and they didn\u2019t come off or feel loose throughout the night. I could have reused these if I wanted to but I had to remove them quickly so I just cut them down and used a metro card to separate them from my nail bed, which never leaves damage for me.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-19","r":3.0,"t":"Beautiful but glue wouldn\u2019t work..","x":"I love Kiss nails and have always had amazing luck with them. I had bought these for Valentine\u2019s Day and was so excited, but the day came and the glue just was not not working, I could barely get it out of the tube and when I did, it would not set up and actually glue the nail to my own. They were beautiful and perhaps it was just my luck to get a bad batch of glue?","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-20","r":4.0,"t":"They look great","x":"I\u2019m writing this review the first day of wearing them so I can\u2019t say how long they last but they look great after I cut them down. The only thing I wish is they had more sizes because they don\u2019t fit perfectly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"Why I didn\u2019t discover this nails several years ago? You save a lot of money! You won\u2019t need to go to the salon anymore. They look natural. They are comfy. Super easy to glue on!!!!!!! Love them! Thanks!!!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-22","r":4.0,"t":"Cute","x":"Really cute and easy to file but i got paint on them and it was pretty much a done deal because their is no way to get paint off without destroying the clear coat","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-23","r":3.0,"t":"Cute style decent longevity","x":"I wanted these to last cause they are SO cute. But they are flimsy and I had two of the nails break :/ still cute if you don\u2019t do any heavy work with your hands","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07DM93SQF-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love love love","x":"Love these nails. Were a little long for me so I cut them a bit and they look like I got them done in the actual nail salon. Will be buying again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the nails as beautiful, pretty, and cute, often receiving compliments.","cites":[1,2,5,6,7,8,11,15]},{"text":"Many customers report the nails are long-lasting, staying on for about two weeks or more.","cites":[1,3,6,10,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the nails are very long, which some find too long or needing filing down.","cites":[9,11,12,14]},{"text":"Multiple customers describe the nails as sturdy, durable, and good quality.","cites":[3,4,6,7,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about weak quality, poor shape, or cheap appearance.","cites":[5,12,13]}]},"qa":[]}